WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Lolly is a Production Studio,

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.320
at the crossroads of civilisation,

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:10.880
a refuge of all the arts against the ravages of time,

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:15.480
armoury of fearless truth against whispering rumour,

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:19.180
the incessant trumpet of trade,

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:20.560
no impostor can sound.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.400
From this place, ideas may fly forward,

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.240
not to perish on shores of change,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:30.240
not to vary with the writer's hand,

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:36.200
but fixed in time, having been verified in proof.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:40.720
Friends, we witness sacred ground

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.720
and a legacy on it.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:45.560
Lolly is a Production Studio.
